  (text "EN\nIO0\nIO9\nIO10\nIO11\nIO12\nIO13\nIO14\nIO17\nIO18\nIO19\nIO20\nIO21\nIO38\nIO39\nIO40\nIO41\nIO47\nIO48"
    (at 246.38 58.42 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "06f7e83c-90f7-4a3d-955b-0707bc7ed3a3")
  )
  (text "EN (SW1 RESET)\nBOOT (SW2, strap)\nLIGHT (ADC1_CH8)\nSD_CS\nCTP_INT\nCTP_SDA (via Q2)\nCTP_RST\nCTP_SCL (via Q1)\nSHT_SCL\nSHT_SDA\nUSB_D- (native)\nUSB_D+ (native)\nSPI_MISO\nLCD_RST\nLCD_DC\nLCD_CS\nSPI_MOSI\nLCD_BL (PWM)\nSPI_SCK"
    (at 255.27 58.42 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "f2369ad4-610a-41cf-a1d1-667572f544db")
  )
  (text "POWER\nUSB-C 5 V only. R1/R2 5.1K on CC1/CC2 = sink.\nF1 PTC 1.1 A, D1 TVS SMF5.0A, U3 ESD on D+/D-.\nU3 drawn flow-through: pins 1/3 connector side,\npins 6/4 ESP32 side (joined inside the chip).\nU2 buck: Vout = 0.6 V x (1 + R3/R4) = 3.32 V.\n\nDISPLAY (MSP3526 plugs straight into J2)\nVCC = 5 V: module LDO + backlight.\nLCD logic via the module 74LVC245: 3.3 V OK.\nTouch I2C has 10K pull-ups to 5 V on the\nmodule, so Q1/Q2 (BSS138) shift it to 3.3 V.\nSPI MOSI/SCK/MISO shared by LCD and microSD.\n\nESP32-S3\nSHT40 has its own I2C bus (IO17/IO18).\nLIGHT on ADC1 (IO9); ADC2 conflicts with Wi-Fi.\nIO35-IO37 used by octal PSRAM (N16R8): NC.\n\nBOOT STRAPS / RESET"
    (at 113.03 115.57 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "edb30575-9909-4a4a-adc6-3631bee3ae6a")
  )
